  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for wpa_supplicant",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for wpa_supplicant fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-78807: missing validation in driver-based PMKSA selection within wpa_supplicant can allow local security bypasses (bsc#1280914).\n- Fixed incomplete RADIUS Message-Authenticator attribute validation in hostapd\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
